{"id":"519585441419362305","summary":"Dive into the #1 2D battle royale game in the world - now on Discord. 100 player, real-time multiplayer action with vibrant graphics and dynamic gameplay all packed in 5 minute matches. How many victories can you get while decking yourself out in the fresh cosmetics?","sku":{"id":"519338998791929866","type":1,"product_line":null,"dependent_sku_id":null,"application_id":"519338998791929866","manifest_labels":["519659006269063219"],"access_type":1,"name":"ZombsRoyale.io","features":[2,4,6,7,8,11,12],"release_date":"2018-03-14","premium":false,"slug":"zombsroyale-io","flags":0,"genres":[48,1,23],"legal_notice":"\u00a9 ZombsRoyale.io. By installing the Application you agree to our Terms of Use (https://zombsroyale.io/terms) and Privacy Policy (https://zombsroyale.io/privacy).","application":{"id":"519338998791929866","name":"ZombsRoyale.io","icon":"884bef241c78b0e86c41f74ec55f7984","description":"Join 30+ millions of players who have played. Compete in the best free 2D 100-person real-time battle royale game online. From the creators of Spinz.io and Zombs.io comes one of the most fun and adrenaline filled battle royale games. Do you have the skills and strategy it takes to be the last one standing in this action packed PvP battle royale game?","summary":"","type":1,"is_monetized":false,"is_verified":false,"is_discoverable":false,"cover_image":"12d765d5015210bef385ac95f694f1e1","primary_sku_id":"519338998791929866","third_party_skus":[{"id":"519338998791929866","sku":"519338998791929866","distributor":"discord"}],"hook":true,"slug":"zombsroyale-io","guild_id":"423618425009471488","storefront_available":false,"bot_public":true,"bot_require_code_grant":false,"integration_types_config":{"0":{}},"verify_key":"6ca9540bbf8ad9c78209bf8af92def21597b4c32441b7c4a344b86db5f24909b","flags":0,"flags_new":"0"},"system_requirements":{"1":{"minimum":{"operating_system_version":"Windows 7","cpu":"Intel Core i3 @ 2.4 GHz","gpu":"Nvidia GeForce GT 240","ram":2048,"disk":500,"sound_card":null,"directx":null,"network":null,"notes":null},"recommended":{"operating_system_version":"Windows 10","cpu":"Intel Core i5 @ 2.4 GHz","gpu":"Nvidia Geforce GTX 660","ram":4096,"disk":500,"sound_card":null,"directx":null,"network":null,"notes":null}}},"show_age_gate":false,"price":{"amount":0,"currency":"aud","currency_exponent":2},"locales":["en-GB","en-US"],"tenant_metadata":{},"created_at":"2025-08-05T20:53:39.133830+00:00","updated_at":"2025-08-05T20:53:39.135755+00:00"},"tagline":"Dive into this refreshingly fast-paced, 100-player battle royale that's captivated over 45 million players! Daily rewards to Nitro subscribers!","flavor_text":"Extremely realistic graphics","description":"![](asset://539581422391001169)\n![](asset://540254553275105281)\nJoin the 45+ **million** players already playing and get into the action today! Jump into quick games with friends in duo and squad modes, and also choose unique game modes to play in every week. Limited-time game modes rotate every few days! Find out for yourself why ZombsRoyale is one of the 10 most Googled games of 2018.\n![](asset://539570930326700053)\n![](asset://539538424223498250)\n**Cosmetics:** Customize over **3000** unique character cosmetics unlocked via in-game coins, however, some in-game items (non-balance changing) will be available for purchase!\n![](asset://539581422860632094)\n![](asset://539594882411397120)\n**Seasons:** New battle pass seasons are released **EVERY MONTH!** Every season contains limited-time experiences and exclusive cosmetics only available for that season. The battle pass is available in both a free and premium version! Collect everything today with the premium battle pass, including special evolving skins every season.\n![](asset://539570930456854579)\n![](asset://539538427855503370)\nZR has over 10 game modes! Check back constantly for the rotating game modes!\n\n**Solo:** Play by yourself against 99 other solo players in a fight to become the last one standing.\n\n**Duo:** Play with a friend, or auto match with a new teammate!\n\n**Squad:** Assemble a squad of 4 players to prove you're the best team alive, or get auto matched if you don't have 4.\n\n**Zombies:** Team up as a squad to take on other squads while having to deal with hordes of zombies!\n\n**50v50:** 4 player teams not enough? Battle a team of 50 while being put on a team of 50 yourself!\n\n**Superpower:** Defeat other players and collect power-ups; move faster, shoot further, and more!\n\n**Weapons Race:** Small map, no loots, defeat opponents to level up your weapon, be the first to eliminate opponents with the last weapon to win!\n\n**Crystal Clash:** 4v4, select your loadout and be the first to destroy the opposing team's crystal to win!\n\n**Mystery Mode:** What happens when there are only RPGs to use? Snipers only? Shotguns only?\n\n**VIP Mode:** Each squad has a VIP, if this person is eliminated the whole squad is eliminated!","staff_notes":{"content":"A refreshing take on the battle royale genre that's easy to pick up, hard to put down. Graspable mechanics make the game inviting, while the intense action and close calls will have you craving just one more game. \"Oh just one more\" quickly turns into three hours later. ","user":null},"carousel_items":[{"asset_id":"538177236541374465"},{"asset_id":"539679649442299904"},{"asset_id":"538542268680896545"},{"asset_id":"538542266310983699"},{"asset_id":"538542266621493268"},{"asset_id":"538542266277691421"}],"guild":{"id":"423618425009471488","name":"ZombsRoyale.io","icon":"cafe5b3cd7bca8435e0576854edbb3ab","description":"Welcome to ZombsRoyale.io - join 45+ million on the battlefield!","home_header":null,"splash":"2ccfe79eff870bd0680752e056bd4f12","discovery_splash":"2ccfe79eff870bd0680752e056bd4f12","features":["TIERLESS_BOOSTING","FEATURABLE","VIP_REGIONS","INVITE_SPLASH","COMMUNITY_EXP_LARGE_UNGATED","COMMUNITY","VANITY_URL","AUDIO_BITRATE_128_KBPS","STAGE_CHANNEL_VIEWERS_50","AUTO_M